{"sha": "a8c81bef3ba0ac31ffbdbe826ac6040b1031351e", "node_id": "C_kwDOTlnq6NoAKGE4YzgxYmVmM2JhMGFjMzFmZmJkYmU4MjZhYzYwNDBiMTAzMTM1MWU", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Ming-Chiao Chen", "email": "joechen@nttu.edu.tw", "date": "2026-07-29T11:52:29Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Ming-Chiao Chen", "email": "joechen@nttu.edu.tw", "date": "2026-07-29T11:52:29Z"}, "message": "Add four figures, downscaled for the web\n\nfigure-01 for the method, 06 beside the sweep, 07 and 05 with the result.\nChosen for what they add rather than for coverage: 07 makes the bimodal\ndistribution visible in a way the sentence about it cannot, and 05 shows what\ndominating on both axes actually looks like.\n\nThe originals are 600 dpi for print, so four of them would have been a\nmegabyte of line art for a reader on a phone. Resampled to 1,600 px and saved\nas palette PNGs: 1,090 KB down to 342 KB with nothing visible lost, since these\nare flat-coloured plots.\n\nThe plates stay light in dark mode rather than inverting. These are published\nfigures with white grounds; inverting would misrepresent the artwork, so they\nare dimmed slightly instead.", "tree": {"sha": "2dc2c60b9df6d4001e494a9ef5d8e32c7cc90bbc", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/joechen0420/lc-off/git/trees/2dc2c60b9df6d4001e494a9ef5d8e32c7cc90bbc"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/joechen0420/lc-off/git/commits/a8c81bef3ba0ac31ffbdbe826ac6040b1031351e", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/joechen0420/lc-off/commits/a8c81bef3ba0ac31ffbdbe826ac6040b1031351e", "html_url": "https://github.com/joechen0420/lc-off/commit/a8c81bef3ba0ac31ffbdbe826ac6040b1031351e", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/joechen0420/lc-off/commits/a8c81bef3ba0ac31ffbdbe826ac6040b1031351e/comments", "author": {"login": "joechen0420", "id": 28734890, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzM0ODkw", "avatar_url": "https://avat